"than 1,000,000 and at most 1,500,000 share the exemption of 1,000,000 by an "
"allocation agreement; above 1,500,000 none of them has an exemption."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_bc_payroll.source_bc_tax_credits
msgid ""
"Basic personal amount of 13,216 for 2026; indexation of the basic personal "
"tax credits paused for 2027 to 2030. B.C. tax reduction credit of 690 for "
"2026 to 2030 (Budget 2026), net income threshold 25,570, reduction factor "
"3.56%, maximum net income 44,952, indexation paused for 2027 to 2030."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_bc_payroll
